788
00:49:54.442 --> 00:49:55.650
Excuse me.

789
00:49:55.650 --> 00:49:56.692
Sorry.

790
00:49:56.692 --> 00:49:57.900
Excuse me.

791
00:49:58.692 --> 00:49:59.817
Excuse me.

